.DS_Store
.env
*.log

# One stack re-includes its .env on purpose: https-right-quick/.env holds demo
# credentials that are part of the exercise, published since 2026-03. The exception
# lives in https-right-quick/.gitignore, not here — that file has its own `.env` rule,
# and a nested .gitignore beats a root-level negation, so it cannot be overridden from
# this file. See docker-containers-is-a-compose-stack-library.md in Dojobrain.
